{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "fh5euvrfvvv5z651", "title": "Prometheus全面监控MySQL服务", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"PzweV\" id=\"PzweV\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7977b7f\" id=\"ub7977b7f\">简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucd01458c\" id=\"ucd01458c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a0f31fe\" id=\"u0a0f31fe\">在现代应用中，MySQL数据库的性能和稳定性对业务至关重要。有效的监控可以帮助预防问题并优化性能。Prometheus作为一款强大的开源监控系统，结合Grafana的可视化能力，可以提供全面的MySQL监控方案。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u257c59a0\" id=\"u257c59a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2599bbf8\" id=\"u2599bbf8\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee9f0622\" id=\"uee9f0622\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ef8c5c6\" id=\"u0ef8c5c6\">设置Prometheus</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0183ddb7\" id=\"u0183ddb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73c05d94\" id=\"u73c05d94\">安装Prometheus</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf8b36cd1\" id=\"uf8b36cd1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf17586e4\" id=\"uf17586e4\">使用Docker安装Prometheus:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua1ef736d\" id=\"ua1ef736d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued7f34ae\" id=\"ued7f34ae\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ude56270b\" id=\"ude56270b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03bfdc20\" id=\"u03bfdc20\">docker run -d --name=prometheus -p 9090:9090 prom/prometheus</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u916f0302\" id=\"u916f0302\"><span data-lake-id=\"u819f7745\" id=\"u819f7745\"> </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u76a121c2\" id=\"u76a121c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88cbc27a\" id=\"u88cbc27a\">此命令将Prometheus运行在本地的9090端口。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1c55a79\" id=\"ud1c55a79\"><span data-lake-id=\"u384889fa\" id=\"u384889fa\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ZY5mN\" id=\"ZY5mN\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02632c57\" id=\"u02632c57\">基本配置</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud6ac5975\" id=\"ud6ac5975\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua63f3d82\" id=\"ua63f3d82\">创建一个Prometheus配置文件prometheus.yml:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22global%3A%5Cn%20%20scrape_interval%3A%2015s%5Cnscrape_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20-%20job_name%3A%20'prometheus'%5Cn%20%20%20%20static_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20targets%3A%20%5B'localhost%3A9090'%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JyShX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u06a6407a\" id=\"u06a6407a\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1bcc5a82\" id=\"u1bcc5a82\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79097588\" id=\"u79097588\"> </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u607b70a5\" id=\"u607b70a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ce05f6b\" id=\"u5ce05f6b\">上面是官网提供的docker命令安装方案，官方直达链接，也可在Windows的docker中安装运行演示的，下面简单记录一下Windows安装的步骤细节</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3ba1f684\" id=\"u3ba1f684\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16a834b3\" id=\"u16a834b3\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucf88a4f9\" id=\"ucf88a4f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02231bf6\" id=\"u02231bf6\">在指定路径下添加一下普罗米修斯的配置文件</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7bc08d4\" id=\"ud7bc08d4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43518495%2F1728305661055-6dfcffb7-9c1e-4ed2-a978-46c66a281b9b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4c1024a3-8dd5-42a4-bdc4-6e4c293050f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u36be5ec4-5350-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A999%2C%22originHeight%22%3A278%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud987a648%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud2b0c82b\" id=\"ud2b0c82b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b66ffe6\" id=\"u0b66ffe6\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u234e790a\" id=\"u234e790a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02463d2b\" id=\"u02463d2b\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3cd15c5e\" id=\"u3cd15c5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdabb02e\" id=\"ucdabb02e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8466e808\" id=\"u8466e808\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u97511c87\" id=\"u97511c87\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud58daa73\" id=\"ud58daa73\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef1a856c\" id=\"uef1a856c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u430d7a98\" id=\"u430d7a98\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u26d833ac\" id=\"u26d833ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaec9494f\" id=\"uaec9494f\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue5e432fa\" id=\"ue5e432fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3644ca18\" id=\"u3644ca18\">文件的详细信息展示</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%23%20my%20global%20config%5Cnglobal%3A%5Cn%20%20scrape_interval%3A%2015s%20%23%20Set%20the%20scrape%20interval%20to%20every%2015%20seconds.%20Default%20is%20every%201%20minute.%5Cn%20%20evaluation_interval%3A%2015s%20%23%20Evaluate%20rules%20every%2015%20seconds.%20The%20default%20is%20every%201%20minute.%5Cn%20%20%23%20scrape_timeout%20is%20set%20to%20the%20global%20default%20(10s).%5Cn%5Cn%23%20Alertmanager%20configuration%5Cnalerting%3A%5Cn%20%20alertmanagers%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20-%20static_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20targets%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20-%20alertmanager%3A9093%5Cn%5Cn%23%20Load%20rules%20once%20and%20periodically%20evaluate%20them%20according%20to%20the%20global%20'evaluation_interval'.%5Cnrule_files%3A%5Cn%20%20%23%20-%20%5C%22first_rules.yml%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%23%20-%20%5C%22second_rules.yml%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%23%20A%20scrape%20configuration%20containing%20exactly%20one%20endpoint%20to%20scrape%3A%5Cn%23%20Here%20it's%20Prometheus%20itself.%5Cnscrape_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20%23%20The%20job%20name%20is%20added%20as%20a%20label%20%60job%3D%3Cjob_name%3E%60%20to%20any%20timeseries%20scraped%20from%20this%20config.%5Cn%20%20-%20job_name%3A%20%5C%22prometheus%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20metrics_path%20defaults%20to%20'%2Fmetrics'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20scheme%20defaults%20to%20'http'.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20static_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20targets%3A%20%5B%5C%22127.0.0.1%3A9090%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20-%20job_name%3A%20%5C%22mysql%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20metrics_path%20defaults%20to%20'%2Fmetrics'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20scheme%20defaults%20to%20'http'.%5Cn%5Ct%23%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E5%81%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87docker%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8Edocker%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E7%BB%99%E7%BD%91%E8%B7%AF%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E7%9A%84ip%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9Cip%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20static_configs%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20targets%3A%20%5B%5C%22192.168.28.3%3A9104%5C%22%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22col